 <umutcagand@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:12:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] universal7904: Build libhwjpeg with the Samsung legacy
 V4L2 layout

Photo capture froze: the camera HAL wrote the JPEG size and format
at Samsung UAPI offsets that the upstream-layout libhwjpeg did not read.
Needs the HWJPEG_SAMSUNG_LEGACY_V4L2 switch in libhwjpeg merged first.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Icddea47a0557a7ae1039c1bac373d8ea3301baaf
---
 BoardConfigCommon.mk | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/BoardConfigCommon.mk b/BoardConfigCommon.mk
index 568e85e..269a635 100644
--- a/BoardConfigCommon.mk
+++ b/BoardConfigCommon.mk
@@ -83,6 +83,10 @@ $(call soong_config_set,arm_gralloc,MFC_CHROMA_VALIGN,$(BOARD_MFC_CHROMA_VALIGN)
 # Gralloc: allow mapper 2.x
 $(call soong_config_set_bool,libui,legacy_gralloc,true)
 
+# libexynoscamera3 inlines libhwjpeg accessors built with the Samsung
+# 17-plane V4L2 UAPI
+$(call soong_config_set_bool,libhwjpeg,HWJPEG_SAMSUNG_LEGACY_V4L2,true)
+
 # AVB (only needed for signing)
 BOARD_AVB_ENABLE := false
 
